  "premise_review": [
    "Preserve {C : Type u}, [Category.{v} C], universe w, and T : Folder.Site.Pretopology.{u,v,w} C exactly.",
    "Base is an arbitrary predicate on the original Folder.Site.Cover C U carrier. The wrapper requires hbase : ∀ U S, Base U S → T.IsCover S.",
    "The conclusion additionally assumes Folder.Site.GeneratedCover T Base U S and returns T.IsCover S. It does not assert that an arbitrary finite family is covering.",
    "The full2683-byte captured GeneratedTopology provider was read as context: its GeneratedCover constructors are base, identity, pullback with explicit T.PullbackData S f witness, and transitive closure of member families.",
    "The provider minimality proof proceeds by induction and uses hbase plus the supplied T.identityCovering, T.pullbackStable and T.transitiveCovering fields. The wrapper copies the original qualified provider call without constructing those fields.",
    "No concrete pretopology, universal pullback provider, Grothendieck topology, sheaf/descent theorem or unconditional topology-existence result is added.",
    "The sole theorem signature and proof term, all implicit universe/category context and full original provider qualifications are byte-exact. Only the enclosing namespace and attribution/status comment differ."
  ],
